galmon (0.20250101-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Update packaging for Debian Trixie / armhf cross-build
  * Update Build-Depends: add libprotobuf-dev, protobuf-compiler, libssl-dev,
    libncurses-dev, libeigen3-dev
  * Switch to debhelper-compat 13
  * Exclude navparse, reporter, galmonmon from build (require libh2o-evloop,
    removed from Debian Trixie)
  * Add libeigen3-dev for coverage.cc (used by sp3feed)
  * Pass cross-compiler via DEB_HOST_GNU_TYPE to Makefile
  * Skip help2man man page generation (incompatible with cross-compilation)
  * Generate githash.h and navmon.pb.cc during build
  * Switch source format to 3.0 (native)

